  <p>The MLOps lifecycle is circular: monitor production models, detect drift, return to experimentation, validate improvements, and redeploy. This continuous cycle is where MLOps truly adds value. Unlike traditional software, ML models must continuously adapt to changing data and requirements.</p>

  <div class="key-takeaway">
