      <li>The MLOps lifecycle is iterative: ideation → experiment → validate → deploy → monitor</li>
      <li>Reproducibility and governance are foundational to enterprise ML systems</li>
      <li>Data and model versioning are as critical as code versioning in MLOps</li>
